Use `nothing` explicitly. Type system prevents unexpected nulls.

## Design Examples

### Variable Declaration
```redblue
set name to "Alice"
set age to 30
set score to 95.5
set active to yes
set items to []
set data to nothing
```

### Conditional Logic
```redblue
if temperature is greater than 30
    say "It's hot!"
else if temperature is less than 10
    say "It's cold!"
else
    say "It's comfortable"
end
```

### Loops
```redblue
// Count from 1 to 10
repeat 10 times
    say "Hello"
end

// Loop through items
for each person in people
=== 220-240
        else
            give back 0
        end
    end
end
```

### Async Operations
```redblue
async to fetch users()
    set response to wait network.get("https://api.example.com/users")
    give back json.parse(response)
end

async to process all()
    parallel
        set users to wait fetch_users()
        set products to wait fetch_products()
        set orders to wait fetch_orders()
